{"id":"5505","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5505_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogentitus-and-cumulus-mediocris_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>仍为砧状，该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>是大约45分钟前一个小而孤立的砧状鬃积雨云的余云。</p>\n<p>积云，主要为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展</span>云种，可完成云观测。</p>\n<p>这是放大的图像。详见附图。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，赫尔辛基","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"08 July 2011 1450 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5506_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbigenitus-and-cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>仍为砧形，该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>是大约45分钟前一个小而孤立的砧状鬃积雨云的余云。在发展的衰退阶段，新的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状鬃积雨云</span>在左侧地平线约60公里外。在该单体的侧面是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>单体或<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云</span>单体；由于单体距离远且相对较小，无法根据本图做出准确识别。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展</span>云种为主的积云可完成云观测。右侧缩放的单体图像参见附图。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，赫尔辛基","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"08 July 2011 1449 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4850_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>一股南风气流为香港（中国）附近的广东沿岸带来炎热多雨的天气。密集的云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密</span>卷云，是积雨云的残余部分 - 这可进一步将其定义为人为积雨云性。在地平线上可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">秃积雨云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Moon Tong Tsang","location":"中国香港赤鱲角","latitude":"纬度: 22° 18' 56'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 55' 21'' E","date":"14 June 2015 0536 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 3, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5520_main_cirrus-spisatus-cumulonimbogenitus-cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>图片上方的云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>。它是3小时前在中国香港以南及西南方向100公里发展的一系列雷暴的余云。在这浓密的卷云块之下是另一个典型的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>。在更靠近香港的第二行形成了这一稠密云块的母积雨云。在第二行云的东侧还可看到正在发展的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>。这些云处于落日的阴影中（照片拍摄于日落前36分钟）。更靠近香港的是第三行云，其构成是东侧的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展积云</span>和中间不断增大的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">霾</span>已被输送并滞留在近海。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tak Leung Ng","location":"中国，香港，赤鱲角","latitude":"纬度: 22° 18' 30'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 55' 5'' E","date":"06 August 2013 1824 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5 2"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4513_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus-with-cumulus-congestus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>（注：时间仅为估算）</p>\n<p>一团正在消散的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云</span>留下了一小片卷云，并在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2时</span>显示出一些残留降水。其他<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>正沿着横跨德克萨斯狭长地带的南北向陡崖形成。该区域当时处于干燥锋前的东南向低层气流中。当天晚些时候，就在该位置附近向东移动的干燥锋前，发展出了一个强得多的积雨云。</p></div>","copyright":"© C.A. Doswell","location":"Palo Duro Canyon, Texas, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 34° 55' 48'' N","longitude":"经度: 101° 39' 0'' W","date":"28 June 1975 1700 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4508_main_formation-and-dissipation-of-cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>PRE.101、PRE.100、PRE.103、PRE.102中的四张照片展示了多个积雨云在大湖奥基乔比湖东岸低层东风气流作用下形成密卷云的过程。当上升气流从炎热的陆地移向较冷的湖面时，它们逐渐减弱，云层上部持续存在直至仅剩卷云。</p>\n<p>在此图像中，五分钟后（PRE.101之后），云层继续成熟并消散。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">左侧</span>的积雨云顶部变得更显纤维状，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右侧</span>较小的浓积云已开始消散。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.L. Holle","location":"Pahokee, Florida, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 26° 49' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 80° 39' 55'' W","date":"15 August 1973 1057 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4511_main_formation-and-dissipation-of-cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>PRE.101、PRE.100、PRE.103、PRE.102中的四张照片展示了在偏东低层气流下，内陆大湖奥基乔比湖东岸的多个积雨云形成卷层云的过程。当上升气流从受热的陆地移向较冷的水面时，气流减弱，上层云体持续存在直至仅余卷云。</p>\n<p>此照片拍摄于五分钟之后，即第一张照片（PRE.101）的16分钟后。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">左侧</span>的积雨云现已呈现出与首张照片中<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位置5</span>处较早卷云相似的形态。一座新的浓积云塔正开始在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位置6</span>增长，但它也将像本组照片中这些邻近云体一样迅速消散。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.L. Holle","location":"Pahokee, Florida, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 26° 49' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 80° 39' 55'' W","date":"15 August 1973 1108 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}